      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe Graphite stores an encoded texture that includes the thresholds and colors in a way that doesn\u0027t lose information. This could be shared in a utility function in src/gpu for filling the SkBitmap and mean that the thresholds don\u0027t have to be included in a uniform array. Using the uniform array still imposes an upper limit on the size of the gradient.",
